WEBVTT

00:04:28.199 --> 00:04:32.689
may be a contributing factor
to their illnesses.

00:04:32.689 --> 00:04:37.364
We dream to solve problems.

00:04:37.364 --> 00:04:40.263
Unconstrained by reality
and the rules of conventional logic,

00:04:40.263 --> 00:04:43.269
in your dreams, your mind can create
limitless scenarios

00:04:43.269 --> 00:04:45.256
to help you grasp problems

00:04:45.256 --> 00:04:49.295
and formulate solutions
that you may not consider while awake.

00:04:49.295 --> 00:04:51.527
John Steinbeck called it 
the committee of sleep,

00:04:51.527 --> 00:04:53.024
and research has demonstrated

00:04:53.024 --> 00:04:56.612
the effectiveness of dreaming 
on problem solving.

00:04:56.612 --> 00:04:58.958
It's also how renowned chemist 
August Kekule

00:04:58.958 --> 00:05:01.879
discovered the structure 
of the benzene molecule,